  "plan": "1) Explore environment: check for git, python3, openssl, sshd, ssh-keygen, and OS info. 2) Based on results, install required packages if missing, then write and run a setup script that configures the user, SSH, the bare repo, the deploy hook, a TLS cert, and the HTTPS web server. 3) Test the full clone/commit/push/curl flow to verify.",
